<title>HONG KONG: Kowloon Motor Bus 1996 net up 14 percent.</title>
<headline>Kowloon Motor Bus 1996 net up 14 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   131.0    vs 114.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    80.0     vs 69.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    527.74   vs 461.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		     4,451.55 vs 3,973.14</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kowloon Motor Bus Co (1933) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 2-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Kowloon Motor Bus is a franchised public bus service operator.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 104 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 24 cents) vs 91 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
